The '''saddle'''<ref name="Visual Dictionary">''[[Star Wars: The Last Jedi: The Visual Dictionary]]''</ref> was a natural valley at the top of the steps on the [[Temple Island]] on the [[planet]] [[Ahch-To]].<ref name="Episode VII" /> [[Porg]]s, a [[species]] of [[bird]], could be found on the saddle.<ref name="Episode VIII" /> It was once a place of [[meditation]] for the ancient [[Jedi]].<ref name="Exegol" />

In [[34 ABY]], [[Rey Skywalker|Rey]] arrived on the planet and climbed the steps, finding the [[Jedi Master]] [[Luke Skywalker]] on the saddle, looking out over the cliff.<ref name="Episode VII" />

